# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. A shard is captured before every member's
# gate is held, resolving against a snapshot that does not yet exist, while
# the saga it captures is still free to decide and broadcast.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentCapturesBeforeGate
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a shard is captured before the gate is acquired
PERTURBS: CaptureShard

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "capture"
    /\ sh \in MemberShards
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: capture may start while the gates are still being taken.
    /\ phase \in {"gating", "capture"}
    /\ sh \in MemberShards
--- END
